  "description" : "In Earthclear, everyone is born into a fixed role, and villagers are the weakest of all. Most never rise above Level 5—except http://anidb.net/ch150370 [Kagami Kouji], who is Level...999?! On a monster hunt, he meets http://anidb.net/ch150369 [Alice], the Demon King`s daughter, and discovers they share an impossible dream: coexistence between humans and demons. In a world destined for conflict, they charge into battle to defy fate and shatter the rules.\nSource: Crunchyroll\nNote: Episodes 1 and 2 were streamed on Abema, DMM TV, and Crunchyroll on July 2, 2026. Each subsequent episode was streamed one week in advance of the TV broadcast on the same platforms.",
